==Finnish==

===Etymology===
{{unk.|fi}} origin. Cognate to Estonian {{term|inimene}} and Karelian {{term|ihmini}}, old Finnish {{term|inehmo}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈiçmine̞n]|lang=fi}}
* {{audio|fi-ihminen.ogg}}
* {{hyphenation|ih|mi|nen}}

===Noun===
{{infl|fi|noun}}

# A [[human being]].
# A [[person]].
# As a former part of compound (as the stem '''''ihmis-''''') signifying [[human]].

